  "historyNote": "#7681, eff 4-23-02; amd by #8209, eff 11-23-04; ss by #9696, INTERIM, eff 4-23-10, EXPIRES: 10-20-10; ss by #9776-A, eff 10-1-10, EXPIRED: 10-1-18 New. #12650, INTERIM, eff 10-24-18, EXPIRED 4-22-19 New. #12775, eff 5-7-19; ss by #14255, eff 5-23-25, EXPIRES: 5-23-35",
